        <mxCell id="boundary" value="Cancellation denied: show the reason and permitted next action. Unknown result: reconcile the original cancellation attempt.&#10;Rectification: correct the new candidate before issuance; reconcile uncertain sending without repeating successful actions.&#10;SD-CANCEL01 design input. Sage cancellation contract and Spain implementation support remain open; see SPEC-SEI-047." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
